---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Wes & Woodward">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>What this is</h1>
  <p>
    Wes &amp; Woodward covers the Detroit Red Wings through advanced analytics and
    data visualization — expected goals, shot quality, line performance, and the
    numbers underneath the narratives.
  </p>
  <p>
    The name: Wes is the byline. Woodward is Woodward Avenue, the street Little
    Caesars Arena sits on.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every number on this site is pulled nightly from the NHL's public API and
    MoneyPuck's expected-goals model, and every chart is built from that same
    pipeline — no screenshots, no secondhand stats.
  </p>
</Base>
